WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:38.624
Two relevant hits or six: can the score stay the same?

00:00:38.624 --> 00:01:13.568
Evaluation depth is not automatically a retrieval budget

00:01:13.568 --> 00:01:51.516
MRR rewards the first answer arriving early

00:01:51.516 --> 00:02:32.148
MAP rewards many relevant records placed high

00:02:32.148 --> 00:03:13.391
nDCG can reward decisive records more than marginal ones

00:03:13.391 --> 00:03:49.513
Each measure defines a different kind of better

00:03:49.513 --> 00:04:27.909
A fair offline comparison holds the evaluation inputs still

00:04:27.909 --> 00:05:13.567
Unjudged is not the same as irrelevant
